m 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, November to December came in at 49% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 51% and June to July at 111% on the middle. Grid 19092 had its driest year in 1988 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
